WEBVTT

00:18.070 --> 00:19.620
So the big one is here.

00:21.330 --> 00:22.420
So many flies?

00:24.960 --> 00:26.420
Look, this corpse is quite fresh.

00:26.420 --> 00:27.800
Looks like it just died.

00:29.870 --> 00:31.030
Are you illiterate?

00:31.570 --> 00:33.300
Is that how you define "fresh"?

00:34.150 --> 00:35.050
It's weird.

00:39.700 --> 00:40.460
Fast Gun.

00:41.150 --> 00:42.840
If this thing reanimates,

00:43.520 --> 00:44.650
snap that hostage's

00:44.670 --> 00:45.470
head off.

00:45.490 --> 00:46.440
Otherwise,

00:46.920 --> 00:48.150
you'll die with me.

01:00.420 --> 01:01.290
It's a person.

01:06.200 --> 01:07.800
Master, you're still alive?

01:15.870 --> 01:16.920
Are we...

01:17.340 --> 01:18.289
Kill me.

01:20.150 --> 01:21.370
Kill me!

01:22.370 --> 01:23.120
Come on.

01:23.420 --> 01:26.420
It wouldn't be right
to kill you the first time we meet.

01:33.470 --> 01:35.070
I'll get you out of here, huh?

02:35.310 --> 02:36.260
Fast Gun!

02:36.540 --> 02:37.540
Snap his head off!

02:37.640 --> 02:38.350
Snap it off!

03:14.000 --> 03:14.910
Not again!

03:32.060 --> 03:33.470
I told you to snap his head off,
but you didn't.

03:33.470 --> 03:34.510
Useless.

03:37.690 --> 03:38.190
Buddy,

03:38.870 --> 03:39.870
what's your name?

03:40.579 --> 03:41.780
Why are you down here?

03:51.900 --> 03:52.770
[Crew ID]

03:53.110 --> 03:56.030
[Name: Song Cai]

03:56.410 --> 03:57.579
You are Song Cai?

03:59.430 --> 04:01.360
Did you spread the Twilight Grass?

04:05.000 --> 04:05.870
Was it you?

04:09.690 --> 04:10.410
No?

04:11.270 --> 04:13.450
Then who brought
the Twilight Grass to Nan'an

04:13.450 --> 04:14.910
and started spreading it?

04:24.420 --> 04:25.350
What do you mean?

04:29.030 --> 04:30.260
The culprit is

04:30.440 --> 04:33.840
the one who brought
this Evil God's ancestral shrine aboard?

04:35.930 --> 04:38.290
How could such a big ancestral shrine
be brought aboard?

04:38.290 --> 04:39.750
Was it a group of soldiers?

04:44.430 --> 04:45.820
Well, let me ask you.

04:45.850 --> 04:47.520
Is the "NP" you carved on the bed

04:47.520 --> 04:48.900
related to the culprit?

04:56.800 --> 04:57.720
Pi...

04:59.750 --> 05:00.600
Pi...

05:01.230 --> 05:01.980
Pi...

05:16.040 --> 05:16.710
Seriously.

05:17.430 --> 05:19.630
Another one swearing? Calling me a pig?

06:10.070 --> 06:11.510
You're lucky.

06:17.870 --> 06:18.930
Let's go! Let's go!

06:19.120 --> 06:20.190
Who are you two?

06:21.390 --> 06:22.450
Zhang Ruipu is dying,

06:22.450 --> 06:23.910
and you're asking who I am?

06:24.620 --> 06:25.450
Song Cai?

06:26.580 --> 06:27.710
So we've met before.

06:28.330 --> 06:30.390
You were Zhang Ruipu's subordinate.

06:31.150 --> 06:32.159
Pi...

06:33.970 --> 06:34.730
Pi...

06:36.400 --> 06:38.330
He was trying to say pitcher plant.

06:39.390 --> 06:41.590
What does it have to do with the culprit?

06:47.930 --> 06:49.510
How did you follow us out?

06:50.600 --> 06:51.480
Forget it.

06:52.070 --> 06:53.400
Let's leave here first.

06:59.790 --> 07:06.430
[Traitor]

07:08.800 --> 07:09.630
Stop right there!

07:09.630 --> 07:10.400
Easy, easy.

07:10.540 --> 07:16.450
[Zhang Hailou]

07:10.950 --> 07:12.160
I need to see Miss Dong.

07:12.160 --> 07:14.160
I have important matters to report.

07:14.300 --> 07:16.560
You can say what you wanna say right here.

07:17.040 --> 07:17.660
Miss Dong.

07:18.010 --> 07:19.870
There was a disturbance
on the ship just now.

07:19.870 --> 07:21.270
We have already checked it.

07:21.270 --> 07:22.270
Initial assessment shows that

07:22.270 --> 07:23.660
the disturbance came from
the bottom of the hold.

07:23.660 --> 07:24.060
We found

07:24.060 --> 07:25.590
a very strange place there.

07:25.590 --> 07:27.180
We are trying to get inside to check.

07:27.120 --> 07:32.790
[Zhang Hailou]

07:29.540 --> 07:30.810
Zhang Hailou,

07:31.430 --> 07:32.960
what on earth are you doing?

07:34.450 --> 07:36.830
Will you find what I want?

07:38.190 --> 07:39.240
Or...

07:39.860 --> 07:41.340
are you the traitor?

07:50.450 --> 07:54.640
[Zhang Hailou]

09:20.100 --> 09:25.700
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

09:26.190 --> 09:28.680
[Episode 6]

09:30.860 --> 09:33.320
[Countdown: 28 hours]

09:36.700 --> 09:37.500
You're awake?

09:40.530 --> 09:41.500
I thought

09:42.290 --> 09:44.020
you were going to die on my ship.

09:44.460 --> 09:45.720
Here, have some water.

09:53.080 --> 09:55.680
Luckily my wife
knows a little about medicine.

10:00.620 --> 10:01.470
When the ship docks,

10:01.470 --> 10:02.530
you need to get off.

10:02.570 --> 10:04.570
I don't want to get into any trouble.

10:20.370 --> 10:21.080
Buddy.

10:22.250 --> 10:23.430
How long have I been out?

10:23.430 --> 10:24.750
You slept for a whole night.

10:24.750 --> 10:26.500
See? It's already dawn.

10:26.970 --> 10:28.920
Are we still in Balongzhou?

10:29.250 --> 10:29.910
Yes.

10:30.960 --> 10:32.650
I'm delivering goods along the way,

10:32.650 --> 10:33.980
and I'll turn back soon.

10:36.250 --> 10:37.380
I remember your ship

10:38.030 --> 10:39.790
will return to

10:39.810 --> 10:41.610
Balongzhou Pier around 4:00 PM.

10:41.840 --> 10:43.070
Drop me off there.

10:44.360 --> 10:45.420
I have things to do.

10:47.790 --> 10:49.520
How do you know that so clearly?

11:15.710 --> 11:16.450
Buddy,

11:17.300 --> 11:19.600
I know the engine on your ship
isn't working well.

11:19.600 --> 11:20.720
I'll fix it for you.

11:22.290 --> 11:23.500
But can you get me

11:23.530 --> 11:24.860
a ticket for the Nan'an?

11:36.150 --> 11:38.350
Just consider it doing me a small favor.

11:40.150 --> 11:42.280
You know my engine isn't working well?

11:47.520 --> 11:48.720
Can you really fix it?

11:51.080 --> 11:52.000
I can.

12:00.790 --> 12:01.720
It's a deal then.

12:04.500 --> 12:05.260
Buddy,

12:05.760 --> 12:07.290
you're injured this badly.

12:07.870 --> 12:09.070
What do you need to do?

12:09.530 --> 12:11.660
What's more important than your life?

12:13.270 --> 12:15.370
I have to get on the Nan'an
before it sets sail.

12:15.370 --> 12:18.230
Those who spread the toxic weed
are very dangerous.

12:18.250 --> 12:20.180
Zhang Hailou, you must be careful.

12:30.150 --> 12:32.810
Good morning, the fastest gun
in the South Seas.

12:34.700 --> 12:35.870
I've already fixed your nose.

12:35.870 --> 12:36.800
You're welcome.

12:38.510 --> 12:42.070
[Bottom hold of Nan'an]

12:38.700 --> 12:40.030
This tea is really good.

12:41.230 --> 12:41.690
What...

12:42.510 --> 12:44.230
did you do to my room?

12:44.260 --> 12:46.210
We made a major breakthrough
entering the ancestral shrine this time.

12:44.590 --> 12:53.060
[Bottom hold of Nan'an]

12:48.000 --> 12:50.130
Of course, there are also many doubts.

12:50.370 --> 12:51.580
For instance, who

12:51.580 --> 12:53.130
got this ancestral shrine onto the ship?

12:53.130 --> 12:53.870
Such a big scene.

12:53.870 --> 12:54.790
Did Miss Dong know about it?

12:54.790 --> 12:56.030
If she did, how did it get on?

12:56.030 --> 12:57.230
Did the captain know?

12:57.250 --> 12:58.980
How was it declared at customs?

13:04.020 --> 13:04.520
Also,

13:04.740 --> 13:05.830
when we were in the ancestral shrine,

13:05.830 --> 13:07.360
we saw many signs of a fight.

13:07.360 --> 13:08.570
Who left them?

13:09.000 --> 13:11.050
There were also many bullet marks on it.

13:11.050 --> 13:12.450
Don't you know guns best?

13:12.750 --> 13:14.010
What kind of gun was it?

13:16.610 --> 13:17.570
I don't know.

13:17.600 --> 13:18.600
I don't remember!

13:18.700 --> 13:19.650
You have to know.

13:19.650 --> 13:20.850
You have to remember.

13:23.290 --> 13:24.420
Was the gun a Luger?

13:25.000 --> 13:26.330
This is very important.

13:28.700 --> 13:29.300
Oh, right.

13:30.200 --> 13:31.650
After you fell down that tunnel,

13:31.650 --> 13:32.550
what did you see?

13:32.550 --> 13:33.700
Try to think back.

13:34.380 --> 13:36.020
You know that, right?

13:37.620 --> 13:38.790
The tunnel where you could see

13:38.790 --> 13:40.890
many, many versions of yourself.

13:42.150 --> 13:44.150
The one that made you cry out of fear.

13:46.150 --> 13:47.120
Mom!

13:49.370 --> 13:50.150
Think hard,

13:50.370 --> 13:51.150
Fast Gun.

13:53.960 --> 13:55.790
We've fallen into a big scheme.

13:54.840 --> 13:56.760
[Bottom hold of Nan'an]

13:57.000 --> 13:58.130
This is a big scheme.

14:01.580 --> 14:03.000
What big scheme?

14:05.000 --> 14:07.150
You're behind all this!

14:07.250 --> 14:08.000
Black magic.

14:08.290 --> 14:09.480
It's all black magic.

14:09.480 --> 14:11.230
You are the root of all evil.

14:11.480 --> 14:12.770
If I get rid of you,

14:15.110 --> 14:16.570
everything will be over.

14:17.150 --> 14:19.030
It's one thing
if you can't solve the problem.

14:19.030 --> 14:20.980
But you can't try to eliminate
the person who raised it,

14:20.980 --> 14:21.450
right?

14:24.530 --> 14:26.330
The only thing we know now is that

14:26.650 --> 14:27.960
the people who spread the Twilight Grass

14:27.420 --> 14:28.290
[The one who spread the Twilight Grass]

14:28.360 --> 14:29.500
[The Evil God's ancestral shrine]
[Ten years ago]

14:28.460 --> 14:29.460
and those who brought
the Evil God's ancestral shrine on board

14:29.460 --> 14:30.770
are the same group,

14:29.620 --> 14:30.450
[Bottom hold of Nan'an]

14:30.770 --> 14:31.980
which is the group from Panhua Reef.

14:31.980 --> 14:33.400
But what exactly is their goal?

14:33.400 --> 14:34.830
Why did they spread the Twilight Grass?

14:34.830 --> 14:36.410
And why did they bring
this ancestral shrine on board?

14:36.410 --> 14:38.840
What's the connection
between these 2 things?

14:38.840 --> 14:39.770
There's no time.

14:41.000 --> 14:41.600
Shrimpie,

14:41.920 --> 14:43.650
what would you do if you were me?

14:43.940 --> 14:45.990
When you encounter something
in the future,

14:45.990 --> 14:47.050
you must stay calm.

14:47.700 --> 14:48.900
Never act on impulse.

14:49.080 --> 14:50.580
But I have no time.

15:03.050 --> 15:06.250
Think more about
how it will affect the people around you.

15:12.250 --> 15:13.080
Mr. Steven,

15:13.790 --> 15:14.840
do you have faith?

15:19.070 --> 15:20.780
[Dukun]

15:21.340 --> 15:22.000
Very good.

15:22.750 --> 15:24.460
You're giving me a

15:24.790 --> 15:26.450
western magic vibe right now.

15:26.910 --> 15:28.410
What are you trying to do?

15:28.700 --> 15:30.390
I don't believe in these things.

15:30.390 --> 15:31.850
You don't need to believe.

15:32.110 --> 15:33.620
Just do as I say.

15:33.620 --> 15:34.680
Someone else will.

15:37.280 --> 15:38.410
I don't understand.

15:38.750 --> 15:40.500
Will this draw the robbers out?

15:40.520 --> 15:40.990
Yes.

15:41.500 --> 15:42.580
By then, when you see me,

15:42.580 --> 15:43.810
just start reciting the scripture.

15:43.810 --> 15:45.760
The hour is coming!

15:46.080 --> 15:47.270
When you see me,
just start reciting the scripture.

15:47.270 --> 15:49.750
We must face misfortune!

15:50.000 --> 15:50.660
That's all.

15:52.290 --> 15:53.100
Don't worry.

15:53.200 --> 15:54.370
If you can't remember it,

15:54.370 --> 15:55.700
just look in the mirror.

15:55.870 --> 15:57.650
I wrote the scripture on your face.

15:57.650 --> 15:58.650
Zhang!

16:00.650 --> 16:01.710
Hang in there, bro.

16:02.830 --> 16:04.160
Hold on for one more day,

16:05.330 --> 16:06.390
and you can kill me.

16:15.200 --> 16:16.600
You fixed the ship for me.

16:16.910 --> 16:18.570
It's worth more than a ticket.

16:19.910 --> 16:21.110
Here is your payment.

16:23.120 --> 16:25.580
Well, I wish you success
with your business.

16:25.700 --> 16:26.300
Thank you.

16:42.120 --> 16:43.150
This smell...

16:44.290 --> 16:45.410
It's so familiar.

16:50.750 --> 16:52.120
The smell of cured meat.

16:53.990 --> 16:55.700
Why is it here?

17:22.560 --> 17:24.220
Burn all the evidence.

17:24.240 --> 17:25.950
Don't let anyone go!

17:25.980 --> 17:27.200
That adjutant?

17:34.670 --> 17:36.200
Why is he here?

17:41.570 --> 17:43.300
Hello. I want to get on the ship.

17:45.000 --> 17:46.290
Can you expedite it for me?

17:45.680 --> 17:47.720
[Xiacheng Minghua Shipping Company]

17:52.060 --> 17:54.490
[Countdown: 16 hours]

17:56.890 --> 17:57.620
Hello,

17:58.110 --> 17:59.510
I'm looking for someone.

17:59.830 --> 18:01.230
His name is Zhang Hailou.

18:01.750 --> 18:03.480
He wears gold-rimmed glasses.

18:04.530 --> 18:05.750
I'm his brother.

18:06.420 --> 18:07.670
We got separated.

18:08.340 --> 18:09.000
One moment.

18:24.750 --> 18:25.570
Sorry, sir.

18:25.750 --> 18:26.200
We don't have a guest here

18:26.200 --> 18:27.800
under the name Zhang Hailou.

18:39.880 --> 18:41.510
He has another name,

18:41.830 --> 18:42.920
Zhang Ruipu.

18:43.670 --> 18:44.700
[359: Zhang Hailian]

18:44.700 --> 18:47.190
[345: Zhang Ruipu]

19:15.100 --> 19:16.360
I'll wait for him here.

19:16.950 --> 19:18.140
If you see him,

19:18.690 --> 19:19.820
please let him know.

19:20.010 --> 19:20.620
Okay.

19:28.920 --> 19:30.380
The food here is this good?

19:36.310 --> 19:36.830
Good afternoon.

19:36.830 --> 19:37.760
Good afternoon.

19:38.570 --> 19:39.090
Good afternoon.

19:39.090 --> 19:40.050
Good afternoon.

19:40.940 --> 19:42.590
You look really handsome today, buddy.

19:42.590 --> 19:43.290
Who is this?

19:43.380 --> 19:44.190
Hi.

19:44.210 --> 19:45.980
Is that the Miracle Doctor of Balai?

19:45.980 --> 19:48.700
I heard people like him
are born with special abilities.

19:48.700 --> 19:49.380
Yeah.

19:49.690 --> 19:52.090
He does look different from normal people.

20:25.680 --> 20:26.410
Are you okay?

20:26.540 --> 20:27.550
Are you okay?

20:33.880 --> 20:34.380
He...

20:34.400 --> 20:35.370
He's poisoned!

20:35.400 --> 20:36.320
He's poisoned!

20:36.550 --> 20:37.780
Yes, he is!

20:37.850 --> 20:40.700
[Dukun]

20:37.950 --> 20:38.860
I heard

20:39.000 --> 20:41.090
a lot of people in Balai got poisoned
by this stuff.

20:41.090 --> 20:42.510
This poison can be fatal.

20:42.570 --> 20:44.190
Everyone, stay away from him!

20:44.190 --> 20:44.850
Step back!

20:44.880 --> 20:45.880
-Help me...
-Stay away!

20:45.880 --> 20:46.640
Doctor,

20:47.030 --> 20:47.750
save me!

20:48.510 --> 20:50.110
Calm down!

20:50.130 --> 20:50.960
Save me!

20:50.960 --> 20:54.380
Pull yourself together!
There's one day to go.

21:05.070 --> 21:06.330
Recite the scripture!

21:07.290 --> 21:09.180
The hour is coming!

21:09.200 --> 21:11.250
We must face misfortune!

21:11.330 --> 21:14.680
Only the children who believe in God
will be blessed.

21:14.700 --> 21:16.480
O Lord Almighty!

21:16.510 --> 21:19.700
Please bless us and help this poor man!

21:20.370 --> 21:22.190
Oh! Bless us!

22:12.790 --> 22:14.920
The wound hasn't healed after so long.

22:22.100 --> 22:22.970
Zhang Hailou,

22:23.910 --> 22:24.780
where are you?

22:26.230 --> 22:27.510
I can't smell you.

22:51.470 --> 22:52.300
Hailou?

22:58.960 --> 23:00.350
What happened over there?

23:00.350 --> 23:02.330
I heard someone was poisoned
by that deadly grass poison,

23:02.330 --> 23:05.130
and a doctor is trying to save him
right on the spot.

23:39.610 --> 23:40.660
I'm cured?

23:40.900 --> 23:42.000
I'm cured!

23:47.440 --> 23:48.370
That's amazing.

23:49.650 --> 23:50.710
Thank you, doctor!

23:50.870 --> 23:52.170
Thank you!

23:53.070 --> 23:53.840
Miracle Doctor of Balai!

23:53.840 --> 23:55.160
Miracle Doctor of Balai!

23:55.160 --> 23:56.790
-Thank you, Miracle Doctor of Balai!
-Miracle Doctor of Balai!

23:56.790 --> 24:00.630
-Miracle Doctor of Balai!
-Miracle Doctor of Balai!

24:00.660 --> 24:01.940
This idiot.

24:03.270 --> 24:04.660
What is he up to?

24:04.680 --> 24:06.360
In the future, if you have any illnesses,

24:06.360 --> 24:07.510
just come to Steven.

24:07.510 --> 24:09.000
Steven can solve them all for you.

24:09.000 --> 24:09.750
Got it?

24:09.810 --> 24:11.520
Come on, a round of applause!

24:15.070 --> 24:17.880
He's a messenger sent by heaven
to help us!

24:22.770 --> 24:25.110
Steven! Steven!

24:31.810 --> 24:33.670
So what does that mean, Adjutant?

24:45.110 --> 24:46.000
Strange.

24:46.550 --> 24:48.410
Such a strong smell of cured meat,

24:48.720 --> 24:50.380
how come no one else smells it?

24:52.900 --> 24:54.430
Is it just me?

25:04.510 --> 25:15.070
Miracle Doctor! Miracle Doctor!
Miracle Doctor!

25:15.090 --> 25:16.630
None of this is right.

25:18.530 --> 25:19.930
I'll draw them away first

25:20.390 --> 25:21.450
to protect Hailou.

25:23.810 --> 25:25.660
This is an illness
that taking Chinese medicine

25:25.660 --> 25:27.080
and having surgery cannot solve.

25:27.080 --> 25:28.350
But here today,

25:28.350 --> 25:30.210
we witnessed a miracle!

25:30.570 --> 25:32.850
This is a miracle!

25:58.310 --> 25:59.630
It really is poison.

26:23.040 --> 26:24.190
Stay awake.

26:25.120 --> 26:26.120
Stay awake.

26:27.740 --> 26:28.870
Think of something.

26:39.880 --> 26:41.210
The smell of cured meat?

30:03.200 --> 30:04.270
He's dead?

30:08.570 --> 30:10.100
It's not a human-skin mask.

30:12.300 --> 30:13.830
It really is that adjutant.

31:08.360 --> 31:09.360
Where am I?

31:14.890 --> 31:16.090
Where is Chen Xifeng?

31:26.720 --> 31:28.260
Why can't I move?

31:38.750 --> 31:40.270
This guy spits razor blades.

31:40.270 --> 31:42.070
We can't keep him under control.

31:42.570 --> 31:43.770
How about we kill him?

31:44.330 --> 31:46.330
That guy in the wheelchair is smart.

31:47.030 --> 31:48.290
Let's give him a chance

31:48.380 --> 31:49.710
and make him work for us.

31:51.500 --> 31:53.070
Too bad he can't walk.

31:53.220 --> 31:54.350
Let's just kill him.

31:54.570 --> 31:55.290
Then let's

31:55.460 --> 31:57.110
ask the great god

31:57.130 --> 31:58.680
to swap their legs,

31:58.830 --> 32:00.500
so the smart one can stand.

32:31.770 --> 32:32.850
Shrimpie.

32:33.800 --> 32:34.960
Zhang Haixia.

32:48.130 --> 32:49.970
I was just in the wheelchair.

32:54.470 --> 32:55.720
Zhang Hailou.

32:57.490 --> 32:58.750
It's fine. I won't die.

32:59.500 --> 33:00.870
I'll take you out first.

33:03.210 --> 33:04.010
What's wrong?

33:05.250 --> 33:06.380
I can't feel my legs.

33:15.070 --> 33:16.070
These are...

33:56.970 --> 33:57.820
My legs...

34:04.180 --> 34:05.600
I can feel my legs now.

34:11.409 --> 34:12.409
They got swapped.

34:45.010 --> 34:45.800
Shrimpie.

34:47.420 --> 34:48.630
You can stand up now.

34:50.650 --> 34:51.560
Impossible.

34:52.980 --> 34:55.580
How can there be a way
to swap legs in this world?

34:55.960 --> 34:57.360
Something must be wrong.

35:02.730 --> 35:03.860
Let's get out first.

35:08.670 --> 35:09.210
Come on.

35:09.510 --> 35:09.970
Come.

35:19.790 --> 35:20.740
Leave me behind.

35:21.780 --> 35:23.440
I can't burden you and Mentor.

35:23.800 --> 35:24.920
Nonsense.

35:26.920 --> 35:28.580
I will definitely get you out.

35:30.730 --> 35:32.660
You know this feeling best, right?

35:34.380 --> 35:36.110
I can never walk again.

35:38.210 --> 35:40.260
And I can never go on missions again.

35:43.260 --> 35:46.360
I'm just a burden, right?

35:48.880 --> 35:50.210
You're not a burden.

36:00.620 --> 36:01.430
Look.

36:02.530 --> 36:03.800
Now that you're in trouble,

36:03.800 --> 36:04.970
I can't help at all.

36:05.740 --> 36:07.170
I only drag you down.

36:08.540 --> 36:09.840
Put me down.

36:12.230 --> 36:13.430
Stop messing around!

36:14.400 --> 36:15.630
You'll die here.

36:16.130 --> 36:17.260
Then let me die.

36:18.150 --> 36:20.080
If I become a burden to you,

36:22.510 --> 36:23.240
I...

36:23.550 --> 36:24.710
I'd rather die.

36:25.960 --> 36:27.100
You're my brother.

36:28.900 --> 36:30.090
Stay alive for me.

36:30.780 --> 36:31.780
I can't

36:31.780 --> 36:32.640
live like this.

36:36.550 --> 36:37.190
Kill me.

36:40.960 --> 36:41.570
Help me.

36:43.210 --> 36:44.740
I shouldn't live like this.

36:52.890 --> 36:55.910
You know this feeling best, right?

36:57.820 --> 37:01.500
And I can never go on missions again.

37:02.090 --> 37:05.400
You are just a burden.

37:06.930 --> 37:10.430
You shouldn't even be alive.

37:10.840 --> 37:14.110
You will drag everyone down,

37:14.880 --> 37:19.190
including your mentor and Zhang Hailou.

37:19.630 --> 37:24.400
Do it, Zhang Haixia.

37:46.980 --> 37:48.230
He was poisoned
by the Twilight Grass Poison,

37:48.230 --> 37:49.730
yet he has managed to hold on for so long.
